  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Clean Cities Blue Ocean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Clean Cities Blue Oceans (CCBO) program will prevent ocean plastics pollution by building capacity to reduce, reuse, and recycle (3Rs) and implement solid waste management in urban and peri-urban settings, particularly in riverine and coastal areas. The CCBO focal countries are the Philippines, Vietnam, Sri Lanka, Maldives, Indonesia, The Dominican Republic, and Peru. The project is contributing to gender equality by focusing on empowerment of women in the solid waste management sector, which has traditionally been a male-dominated sector. The project is working to strengthen women prospering in the workforce, succeeding as entrepreneurs/businesses leaders, as well as their participation in the economy overall.</narrative>
  </description>
